			"url": "https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw/discussions/2533#discussioncomment-230618",
			"summary": "The contributor who built the original chart feature favours letting users pick bar, single-line or donut at paste time, wants complexity kept low, and agrees no metadata should be stored so the elements stay freely editable.",
